s` | Works (reads issue body sections) | COVERED |\\n| Wave dispatch state (SQLite) | All `dispatch_*` tools | Backend-independent (SQLite) | COVERED |\\n| Artifact manifest (content) | `artifact_register(content=...)` | Needs `BeadsArtifactProvider` | PARTIAL |\\n| `verified=True` status label | `backlog_update(verified=True)` | No label system in beads | MISSING |\\n\\n### Systems Inventory\\n\\n- `plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/backend_protocol.py` | Role: producer | Connection: defines `BacklogBackend` Protocol and `create_backend()` factory; must add `\\\"beads\\\"` to `_VALID_BACKENDS` and new branch | Action: CODE_CHANGE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/artifact_provider.py` | Role: producer | Connection: defines `ArtifactBackend` Protocol, `BackendName` enum, and `create_artifact_provider()`; must add `beads` enum member and `BeadsArtifactProvider` branch | Action: CODE_CHANGE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/task_config.py` | Role: producer | Connection: defines `TaskBackend` factory `create_task_backend()`; must add `\\\"beads\\\"` branch | Action: CODE_CHANGE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/backends/beads_backend.py` | Role: producer | Connection: new file; `BeadsBackend` implementing `BacklogBackend` Protocol via `bd` CLI subprocess | Action: CODE_CHANGE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/server.py` | Role: consumer | Connection: consumes `BacklogConfig` from `create_backend()`; prior beads removal comment at lines 107-111; must not use startup hook for `bd` installation | Action: VERIFY_COMPATIBLE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/server.py` | Role: consumer | Connection: stores `parent_issue_number` in `ActiveTaskContext`; field is `int | None`; must be widened to `str | int | None` for non-integer beads IDs | Action: CODE_CHANGE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/context_backend.py` | Role: producer | Connection: `ContextBackend` Protocol; `ActiveTaskContext.parent_issue_number` type annotation must be widened | Action: CODE_CHANGE | Risk: MEDIUM\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/task_status_hook.py` | Role: consumer | Connection: line 807 `int(data[\\\"parent_issue_number\\\"])` raises `ValueError` for string beads IDs; widened type + `contextlib.suppress(TypeError, ValueError)` already present on the MCP call variant but not on the file-read variant (line 807) | Action: CODE_CHANGE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/implementation_manager.py` | Role: consumer | Connection: `fetch_tasks_from_github(parent_issue_number: int, ...)` is entirely GitHub-specific; no beads code path | Action: CODE_CHANGE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/tests/test_cross_backend.py` | Role: test | Connection: cross-backend conformance matrix; no beads row | Action: TEST_UPDATE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/tests/test_backend_toml_search.py` | Role: test | Connection: `_VALID_BACKENDS` resolution; beads branch not covered | Action: TEST_UPDATE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/tests/test_task_backend_conformance.py` | Role: test | Connection: `TaskBackend` Protocol conformance; `BeadsTaskProvider` not in matrix | Action: TEST_UPDATE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/tests/test_artifact_provider_fallback.py` | Role: test | Connection: artifact provider tests; no beads provider coverage | Action: TEST_UPDATE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/docs/backend-providers.md` | Role: documentation | Connection: Required Reading for backend extension work; lists only 3+3 valid backend names | Action: CONTENT_UPDATE | Risk: HIGH\\n- `plugins/development-harness/CLAUDE.md` | Role: documentation | Connection: agent-facing system prompt; Backend Providers section lists valid backend names without beads | Action: CONTENT_UPDATE | Risk: HIGH